# Binary assets must never have their line endings converted. Test upload files
# such as the sample PDFs are plain ASCII, so Git would otherwise treat them as
# text and rewrite LF to CRLF on Windows checkouts - which shifts the byte
# offsets a PDF's cross-reference table depends on.
*.pdf   binary
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.gif   binary
*.webp  binary
*.svg   binary
*.xlsx  binary
*.zip   binary
